{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636020409749340161","content":"||\"Greetings my fellow passengers. I stand before you, in this Zone of Truth, helpfully prepared by Leaf to allay your fears and suspicions. I have not killed Rahvioli. I was not in any manner involved in his death. I do not know who killed Rahvioli. I am not without sin, and I have acted in secrecy, but I am innocent of these crimes. Further, I would like to state that I am not a member of the Golden Dawn. I have never been a member of the Golden Dawn, and, excepting the Order of Kairo, I am not a member of any secret societies. I do not know the identities of the member or members of the Golden Dawn. I am not the one who has harmed Amara, and I am not the one who burned down her room. I do not know who did these things. Thank you all for coming, and being my witnesses. My statement is done. I will not be taking questions.\"||","created_at":"2020-07-28T18:19:30.855000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737736008317141123","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
